re grid: $\overrightarrow{OA}=\mathbf{a}$, $\overrightarrow{OB}=\mathbf{b}$, and $\overrightarrow{OC}=\mathbf{c}$.

![Vector diagram](images/a7/a7c8651a67d96846172792412818a0b3dca3b473ec064abbfc6a5ddc304be19e.png)

Given that $\mathbf{c}=\lambda\mathbf{a}+\mu\mathbf{b}$, find $\lambda$ and $\mu$.

$\lambda=$ {{field-1}}

$\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "24ebf79a-17a7-5d88-a3c9-9ccc5e4ec0c8" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/16/16e49d3f1ffc9798f206c2fd6e956589f884075bb984fb9a5cf8aa8a8f5addb5.png)

Construct the route $O\to X\to C$, first parallel to $\mathbf{b}$ and then parallel to $\mathbf{a}$.

Along $OX$, move $2$ squares left. A copy of $\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square left. Thus $OX=2|\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{OX}=2\mathbf{b}$.

Along $XC$, move $2$ squares left and $2$ squares down. A copy of $\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square left and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=2|\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{XC}=2\mathbf{a}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=2\mathbf{b}+2\mathbf{a}\\&=2\mathbf{a}+2\mathbf{b}
\end{aligned}
$$

Reorder the terms to match their vector names. Since $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\lambda=2$ and $\mu=2$."] [:db/add "24ebf79a-17a7-5d88-a3c9-9ccc5e4ec0c8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "24ebf79a-17a7-5d88-a3c9-9ccc5e4ec0c8" :question/answer-fields "642c77d9-6474-5691-97f8-eca7e1d8a566"] [:db/add "24ebf79a-17a7-5d88-a3c9-9ccc5e4ec0c8" :question/answer-fields "8a69d291-b8ea-5f04-b93a-89e30dfe8113"] [:db/ensure "24ebf79a-17a7-5d88-a3c9-9ccc5e4ec0c8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "24ebf79a-17a7-5d88-a3c9-9ccc5e4ec0c8"] [:db/add "ca9a3680-3a2a-52d1-b76e-e5573c9f5f49" :answer/id #uuid "ca9a3680-3a2a-52d1-b76e-e5573c9f5f49"] [:db/add "ca9a3680-3a2a-52d1-b76e-e5573c9f5f49" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ca9a3680-3a2a-52d1-b76e-e5573c9f5f49" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "ca9a3680-3a2a-52d1-b76e-e5573c9f5f49" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e1801d11-b878-56a6-a349-2f7b86d97789" :answer-field/id #uuid "e1801d11-b878-56a6-a349-2f7b86d97789"] [:db/add "e1801d11-b878-56a6-a349-2f7b86d97789" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "e1801d11-b878-56a6-a349-2f7b86d97789" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e1801d11-b878-56a6-a349-2f7b86d97789" :answer-field/choices "ca9a3680-3a2a-52d1-b76e-e5573c9f5f49"] [:db/add "e1801d11-b878-56a6-a349-2f7b86d97789" :answer-field/correct "ca9a3680-3a2a-52d1-b76e-e5573c9f5f49"] [:db/ensure "e1801d11-b878-56a6-a349-2f7b86d97789" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9610abe5-88c2-5a6a-9548-130464947fbb" :answer/id #uuid "9610abe5-88c2-5a6a-9548-130464947fbb"] [:db/add "9610abe5-88c2-5a6a-9548-130464947fbb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9610abe5-88c2-5a6a-9548-130464947fbb" :answer/value "4"] [:db/ensure "9610abe5-88c2-5a6a-9548-130464947fbb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bd492817-3b4f-5f52-a867-ec13d1736da4" :answer-field/id #uuid "bd492817-3b4f-5f52-a867-ec13d1736da4"] [: