Given that $\mathbf{c}=\lambda\mathbf{a}+\mu\mathbf{b}$, find $\lambda$ and $\mu$.

$\lambda=$ {{field-1}}

$\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "f3ed1e68-8185-59c7-af32-90da4c194c8f" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/18/185ec3520a1b188d114072bf756f6a7e79400509fb9aa696fcfe0211106deaa9.png)

Construct the route $O\to X\to C$, first parallel to $\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\mathbf{b}$.

Along $OX$, move $4$ squares right and $4$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares right and $2$ squares up. Thus $OX=2|\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{OX}=2\mathbf{a}$.

Along $XC$, move $4$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square up. Thus $XC=4|\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{XC}=4\mathbf{b}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=2\mathbf{a}+4\mathbf{b}
\end{aligned}
$$

Since $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\lambda=2$ and $\mu=4$."] [:db/add "f3ed1e68-8185-59c7-af32-90da4c194c8f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f3ed1e68-8185-59c7-af32-90da4c194c8f" :question/answer-fields "e1801d11-b878-56a6-a349-2f7b86d97789"] [:db/add "f3ed1e68-8185-59c7-af32-90da4c194c8f" :question/answer-fields "bd492817-3b4f-5f52-a867-ec13d1736da4"] [:db/ensure "f3ed1e68-8185-59c7-af32-90da4c194c8f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "f3ed1e68-8185-59c7-af32-90da4c194c8f"] [:db/add "ea0d6f52-b6dc-5398-a420-f2eb2ac0c971" :answer/id #uuid "ea0d6f52-b6dc-5398-a420-f2eb2ac0c971"] [:db/add "ea0d6f52-b6dc-5398-a420-f2eb2ac0c971" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ea0d6f52-b6dc-5398-a420-f2eb2ac0c971" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "ea0d6f52-b6dc-5398-a420-f2eb2ac0c971" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5245cf53-eec4-5f4b-8d6b-7cf7fd927606" :answer-field/id #uuid "5245cf53-eec4-5f4b-8d6b-7cf7fd927606"] [:db/add "5245cf53-eec4-5f4b-8d6b-7cf7fd927606" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "5245cf53-eec4-5f4b-8d6b-7cf7fd927606" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5245cf53-eec4-5f4b-8d6b-7cf7fd927606" :answer-field/choices "ea0d6f52-b6dc-5398-a420-f2eb2ac0c971"] [:db/add "5245cf53-eec4-5f4b-8d6b-7cf7fd927606" :answer-field/correct "ea0d6f52-b6dc-5398-a420-f2eb2ac0c971"] [:db/ensure "5245cf53-eec4-5f4b-8d6b-7cf7fd927606" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "414e0c6f-3aba-596b-89b8-d64153bdb716" :answer/id #uuid "414e0c6f-3aba-596b-89b8-d64153bdb716"] [:db/add "414e0c6f-3aba-596b-89b8-d64153bdb716" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "414e0c6f-3aba-596b-89b8-d64153bdb716" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "414e0c6f-3aba-596b-89b8-d64153bdb716" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ba3691cf-1ef0-54cd-ada6-23c1a5d67bfb" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba3691cf-1ef0-54cd-ada6-23c1a5d67bfb"] [:db/add "ba3691cf-1ef0-54cd-ada6-23c1a5d67bfb" :